{
 "why": {
  "meta": {
   "title": "為什麼選擇 Pain001：五問商業效益",
   "description": "付款檔案遭退回的代價、為什麼 2026 年 11 月 14 日無法更改、Pain001 如何因應、成本多少（零）、是否安全——每個答案均附證據連結。",
   "eyebrow": "商業效益",
   "deck": "CFO 真正在意的五個問題——以淺白語言作答，每項主張均附證據連結。"
  },
  "text": {
   "<a href=\"/\">Home</a>": "<a href=\"/\">首頁</a>",
   "Contents": "目錄",
   "<a href=\"#what-does-a-rejected-payment-file-cost\">What does a rejected payment file cost?</a>": "<a href=\"#what-does-a-rejected-payment-file-cost\">付款檔案遭退回的代價是什麼？</a>",
   "<a href=\"#why-is-14-november-2026-non-negotiable\">Why is 14 November 2026 non-negotiable?</a>": "<a href=\"#why-is-14-november-2026-non-negotiable\">為什麼 2026 年 11 月 14 日無法更改？</a>",
   "<a href=\"#what-does-pain001-do-about-it\">What does Pain001 do about it?</a>": "<a href=\"#what-does-pain001-do-about-it\">Pain001 如何因應？</a>",
   "<a href=\"#what-does-it-cost\">What does it cost?</a>": "<a href=\"#what-does-it-cost\">它的成本是多少？</a>",
   "<a href=\"#is-it-safe\">Is it safe?</a>": "<a href=\"#is-it-safe\">它安全嗎？</a>",
   "<a href=\"#what-is-the-next-step\">What is the next step?</a>": "<a href=\"#what-is-the-next-step\">下一步是什麼？</a>",
   "What does a rejected payment file cost?<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-does-a-rejected-payment-file-cost\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What does a rejected payment file cost?\">#</a>": "付款檔案遭退回的代價是什麼？<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-does-a-rejected-payment-file-cost\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What does a rejected payment file cost?\">#</a>",
   "A file the bank bounces does not fail quietly. Someone diagnoses the reason code, repairs the source data, regenerates, resubmits — and if the repair misses the day's cut-off, settlement slips. For payroll or supplier runs, a slipped day is a phone call you do not want to make. The <a href=\"/pain002-reason-codes/\">reason-code reference</a> lists what banks actually send back; almost every format-class entry on it is preventable before submission.": "遭銀行退回的檔案不會悄悄了事。總得有人診斷原因代碼、修復來源資料、重新產生並重新提交——若修復錯過當日截止時間，清算便會順延。對薪資或供應商付款批次而言，延誤一天就是一通您絕不想撥的電話。<a href=\"/pain002-reason-codes/\">原因代碼參考</a>列出銀行實際回傳的內容；其中幾乎所有格式類項目都能在提交前預先避免。",
   "Why is 14 November 2026 non-negotiable?<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#why-is-14-november-2026-non-negotiable\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Why is 14 November 2026 non-negotiable?\">#</a>": "為什麼 2026 年 11 月 14 日無法更改？<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#why-is-14-november-2026-non-negotiable\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Why is 14 November 2026 non-negotiable?\">#</a>",
   "Because it is enforced at network level, not by policy. From that date, cross-border payments (CBPR+) carrying fully unstructured postal addresses are rejected, and the interbank MT101 relay retires in favour of <code>pain.001</code> version 9. The dates come from SWIFT, not from us — every one is cited in the <a href=\"/2026-iso20022-migration-trends/\">2026 briefing</a>, and the schedule continues to 2028 on the <a href=\"/iso20022-roadmap/\">living roadmap</a>.": "因為它是在網路層級強制執行，而非出於政策。自該日起，攜帶完全非結構化郵政地址的跨境付款（CBPR+）將遭拒收，銀行間 MT101 中繼也將退場，由 <code>pain.001</code> 第 9 版取代。這些日期來自 SWIFT，而非我們——每一項皆於<a href=\"/2026-iso20022-migration-trends/\">2026 年簡報</a>中註明出處，時程表並在<a href=\"/iso20022-roadmap/\">持續更新的路線圖</a>上延續至 2028 年。",
   "What does Pain001 do about it?<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-does-pain001-do-about-it\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What does Pain001 do about it?\">#</a>": "Pain001 如何因應？<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-does-pain001-do-about-it\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What does Pain001 do about it?\">#</a>",
   "Three things. It turns the data you already have — spreadsheets, ERP exports, legacy SWIFT files — into bank-ready ISO 20022 payment files. It proves each file clean before submission: validation against the bank's official rulebook (ISO 20022 XSD), the account-number checksum your bank runs (ISO 13616 mod-97), and control totals recalculated from the records, never trusted. And it does all of this on your own infrastructure — nothing is uploaded anywhere.": "三件事。它將您既有的資料——試算表、ERP 匯出檔、傳統 SWIFT 檔案——轉換為銀行可直接受理的 ISO 20022 付款檔案。它在提交前證明每個檔案皆無瑕疵：依銀行官方規則手冊（ISO 20022 XSD）驗證，執行您的銀行所用的帳號檢核碼（ISO 13616 mod-97），並依紀錄重新計算控制總額，絕不逕行採信。而且這一切都在您自己的基礎設施上完成——任何資料都不會被上傳。",
   "What does it cost?<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-does-it-cost\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What does it cost?\">#</a>": "它的成本是多少？<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-does-it-cost\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What does it cost?\">#</a>",
   "Nothing, at any scale, permanently. The core is dual-licensed (Apache-2.0 or MIT); companion packages are Apache-2.0. The nearest commercial reference point — SWIFT's translation SDK — is publicly listed at €10,000–30,000 per year before integration effort. The full landscape, including where commercial platforms genuinely win, is in the <a href=\"/competitors-comparison/\">comparison</a>.": "零成本，任何規模，永久如此。核心採雙重授權（Apache-2.0 或 MIT）；週邊套件採 Apache-2.0。最接近的商業參照——SWIFT 的轉換 SDK——公開定價為每年 €10,000–30,000，尚不含整合成本。完整全貌，包括商業平台真正勝出之處，詳見<a href=\"/competitors-comparison/\">比較分析</a>。",
   "Is it safe?<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#is-it-safe\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Is it safe?\">#</a>": "它安全嗎？<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#is-it-safe\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Is it safe?\">#</a>",
   "Check rather than trust: payment data <a href=\"/privacy/\">never leaves your machines</a>, the dependency inventory is a published <a href=\"/sbom.cdx.json\">SBOM</a>, the code holds <a href=\"/architecture-and-patents/\">100% branch coverage as a CI gate</a>, and the <a href=\"/try/\">browser demo</a> invites your security team to falsify the claims with DevTools open.": "查證而非輕信：付款資料<a href=\"/privacy/\">絕不離開您的機器</a>，相依套件清單是公開發布的 <a href=\"/sbom.cdx.json\">SBOM</a>，程式碼以 <a href=\"/architecture-and-patents/\">100% 分支涵蓋率作為 CI 關卡</a>，<a href=\"/try/\">瀏覽器示範</a>更歡迎您的資安團隊開著 DevTools 來檢驗這些主張。",
   "What is the next step?<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-is-the-next-step\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What is the next step?\">#</a>": "下一步是什麼？<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-is-the-next-step\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What is the next step?\">#</a>",
   "Watch it work: the <a href=\"/try/\">60-second demo</a> validates a payment batch and proves it against the official schema, in your browser. Then hand your team the <a href=\"/executive-brief/\">executive brief</a> — one page, print-ready, available in <a href=\"/executive-brief-fr/\">French</a>, <a href=\"/executive-brief-de/\">German</a>, and <a href=\"/executive-brief-es/\">Spanish</a>.": "眼見為憑：<a href=\"/try/\">60 秒示範</a>在您的瀏覽器中驗證一個付款批次，並依官方結構描述加以證明。接著將<a href=\"/executive-brief/\">主管簡報</a>交給您的團隊——僅一頁，可直接列印，另有<a href=\"/executive-brief-fr/\">法文</a>、<a href=\"/executive-brief-de/\">德文</a>與<a href=\"/executive-brief-es/\">西班牙文</a>版本。"
  },
