  "text": {
   "<a href=\"/\">Home</a>": "<a href=\"/\">首頁</a>",
   "Contents": "目錄",
   "<a href=\"#the-problem\">The problem</a>": "<a href=\"#the-problem\">問題</a>",
   "<a href=\"#the-deadline\">The deadline</a>": "<a href=\"#the-deadline\">期限</a>",
   "<a href=\"#what-pain001-does\">What Pain001 does</a>": "<a href=\"#what-pain001-does\">Pain001 的功能</a>",
   "<a href=\"#what-it-costs\">What it costs</a>": "<a href=\"#what-it-costs\">成本</a>",
   "<a href=\"#the-evidence\">The evidence</a>": "<a href=\"#the-evidence\">證據</a>",
   "<a href=\"#the-ask\">The ask</a>": "<a href=\"#the-ask\">請求</a>",
   "Read in: <a href=\"/executive-brief-fr/\">Français</a> · <a href=\"/executive-brief-de/\">Deutsch</a> · <a href=\"/executive-brief-es/\">Español</a>": "其他語言：<a href=\"/executive-brief-fr/\">Français</a> · <a href=\"/executive-brief-de/\">Deutsch</a> · <a href=\"/executive-brief-es/\">Español</a>",
   "The problem<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-problem\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The problem\">#</a>": "問題<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-problem\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The problem\">#</a>",
   "Banks reject malformed payment files. Every rejection costs a repair cycle; a repair that misses the day's cut-off costs a settlement day. The rejection reasons are knowable in advance — and therefore preventable.": "銀行會退回格式不符的付款檔案。每次退回都要付出一個修復週期；錯過當日截止時間的修復，則要付出一個清算日。退回原因可以事先掌握——因此可以預防。",
   "The deadline<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-deadline\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The deadline\">#</a>": "期限<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-deadline\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The deadline\">#</a>",
   "<strong>14 November 2026</strong>, enforced at network level: cross-border payments (CBPR+) carrying fully unstructured addresses are rejected, and the legacy interbank MT101 channel retires in favour of ISO 20022 <code>pain.001</code> version 9. The exposure sits in customer master data. Sources: SWIFT, cited in full at pain001.com/2026-iso20022-migration-trends.": "<strong>2026 年 11 月 14 日</strong>，於網路層級強制執行：攜帶完全非結構化地址的跨境付款（CBPR+）將遭拒收，傳統銀行間 MT101 通道退場，由 ISO 20022 <code>pain.001</code> 第 9 版取代。曝險位於客戶主檔資料之中。來源：SWIFT，完整引註見 pain001.com/2026-iso20022-migration-trends。",
   "What Pain001 does<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-pain001-does\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What Pain001 does\">#</a>": "Pain001 的功能<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-pain001-does\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What Pain001 does\">#</a>",
   "An open-source suite that converts existing data — spreadsheets, ERP exports, legacy SWIFT files — into bank-ready ISO 20022 payment files, and proves each file against the bank's official rulebook (ISO 20022 XSD) <em>before</em> submission. It runs entirely on your own infrastructure: no upload, no vendor cloud, no telemetry.": "一套開放原始碼套件，將既有資料——試算表、ERP 匯出檔、傳統 SWIFT 檔案——轉換為銀行可直接受理的 ISO 20022 付款檔案，並在提交<em>之前</em>依銀行官方規則手冊（ISO 20022 XSD）證明每個檔案。它完全在您自己的基礎設施上執行：不上傳、無供應商雲端、無遙測。",
   "What it costs<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-it-costs\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What it costs\">#</a>": "成本<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-it-costs\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What it costs\">#</a>",
   "Nothing, at any scale, under open licences (Apache-2.0 / MIT). Commercial reference point: SWIFT's translation SDK is publicly listed at €10,000–30,000 per year.": "零成本，任何規模，採開放授權（Apache-2.0 / MIT）。商業參照：SWIFT 的轉換 SDK 公開定價為每年 €10,000–30,000。",
   "The evidence<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-evidence\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The evidence\">#</a>": "證據<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-evidence\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The evidence\">#</a>",
